{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>בן בקר</b> — עולה — שנ\"ד — that it must be בן שנה:" "<b>וזרקו את הדם</b> — with cattle it is written את הדם, and with sheep it is written את דמו, because the blood of sheep resembles human blood; therefore it is written דמו, which brings upon it the כ' as though he offered his own blood:"], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {0 "The acronym שנ\"ד is expanded as שנה דלא as a rabbinic formula indicating 'only one year'; rendered here by its expansion בן שנה which the text itself supplies."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:19:29.922867737Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}